{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.631, "n_samples": 87152, "proc_s": 1.1344, "rtf": 0.3124, "samples_sha256": "a1f1ccee9c3d2f3c44bd92786d75051d6a7a8aa53ccaca6acd8eaffaaa71f0ab"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.079, "n_samples": 97898, "proc_s": 1.4731, "rtf": 0.3611, "samples_sha256": "f13838f2e6e291848ecc9cd3bbf8a6d940015c22ea5e3516c69a4f6c08de3b17"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.082, "n_samples": 73978, "proc_s": 0.8588, "rtf": 0.2786, "samples_sha256": "a29c865bacec91790c98a29251e85bda23998a4962f950e918c97ec4b44e977a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.192, "n_samples": 76620, "proc_s": 0.943, "rtf": 0.2954, "samples_sha256": "3b6c4485428a004293a0df5dab496357442daecacd77a9b3153f2d96db71f418"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.669, "n_samples": 64046, "proc_s": 0.8054, "rtf": 0.3018, "samples_sha256": "6567e1c1332b1b257842ffcc14b7bf68b0e74d377ecd96cb431c2e3c41a59d2c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.861, "n_samples": 68656, "proc_s": 1.0037, "rtf": 0.3509, "samples_sha256": "c25ffbeae913287ba82e5aad7f7e6a93bac761e12a3ded4e1c29107fe25a3152"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.082, "n_samples": 97967, "proc_s": 1.3297, "rtf": 0.3258, "samples_sha256": "5640576a74516d5e291266cc1e214285a48a3dda0a576c319fc92fca01cf5d8e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.11, "n_samples": 74644, "proc_s": 0.8775, "rtf": 0.2822, "samples_sha256": "9d8a45450089b99590c9707e16bf6cb7230a89fd1244a51933eef244236521d8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.129, "n_samples": 75087, "proc_s": 1.1146, "rtf": 0.3563, "samples_sha256": "15166bd570fbb6f177011c37c5e3b349ad18d4a7a9ebe29007a719f27e43ae21"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.379, "n_samples": 81089, "proc_s": 1.2541, "rtf": 0.3712, "samples_sha256": "8bc66c7373f3a3775a31542569d16106c857610ab63f3ada603faed715bae19e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.41, "n_samples": 57846, "proc_s": 0.8213, "rtf": 0.3407, "samples_sha256": "f11a5a34d21fb7e7eec8f11d912c86cf6563070748fff86aa6187139710fa444"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.436, "n_samples": 82458, "proc_s": 1.0539, "rtf": 0.3067, "samples_sha256": "b9fc1556b2e6beb1e8e4634a943fec4394a0806af8a0acd92dcabeb952022d09"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.626, "n_samples": 87034, "proc_s": 1.407, "rtf": 0.388, "samples_sha256": "05beb27550c88d3b44ffe850bd709f1e62cea092d05256351cc69c31bf95177c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.635, "n_samples": 111247, "proc_s": 1.5195, "rtf": 0.3278, "samples_sha256": "bb5b4e0c2d3160fbc2886eb777589248b196a6e644a7215fd529943384135730"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.252, "n_samples": 78039, "proc_s": 1.087, "rtf": 0.3343, "samples_sha256": "9e8f787e50b351f628ed51e0cc6f56d8c8d819a3fc1f7edf706ba183b2728ac9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.974, "n_samples": 71364, "proc_s": 0.8548, "rtf": 0.2875, "samples_sha256": "d73a56cff3cdfd24bafe53d1730ab93ad305c465425b2953885bc63400736931"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.364, "n_samples": 80730, "proc_s": 1.1269, "rtf": 0.335, "samples_sha256": "991c0696929fd44a6ea901f3f922d61778a67141009173505c57077a12782419"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.991, "n_samples": 71789, "proc_s": 0.9001, "rtf": 0.3009, "samples_sha256": "554c1b64f23c03e41df258d49f9e551d1e1c8f70db8cd821b3334e4726e1224a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.872, "n_samples": 44920, "proc_s": 0.5908, "rtf": 0.3156, "samples_sha256": "82d8a6d5a220e36f23efac40430c9228b1375bfc214b259188d304be0adf8ea1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.409, "n_samples": 81822, "proc_s": 1.2049, "rtf": 0.3534, "samples_sha256": "0a2975bb909bde2bed4bba5157ce964a60e15cc29e3ae46fdab0c48e44427fda"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.142, "n_samples": 75407, "proc_s": 1.0786, "rtf": 0.3433, "samples_sha256": "8341c2c973818167d0df17fe0cfc935cd3a9367bdfc5078f8c5b14865f3634e4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid51", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.88, "n_samples": 93114, "proc_s": 1.2337, "rtf": 0.318, "samples_sha256": "9a7e8ccb34539636a468ffb2ddfeab88edd77d70afa756823fec155ac140d117"}
